 "words": 152,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I'm going fishing, Peter said",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And we went with him too",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All night we fished on Galilee",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And not a fish came through",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At dawn a man stood on the shore",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Have you any fish, my friends",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Cast the net on the right side",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And you will find some then",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Cast the net on the right side",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Haul it in, haul it in",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A hundred fifty three great fish",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the net was not torn",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 5.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "It is the Lord, said John to him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Peter jumped into the sea",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A fire of coals upon the beach",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With fish and bread for free",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Come and have breakfast, Jesus said",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And no one dared to ask",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They knew it was the Lord himself",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who served them at the last",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Cast the net on the right side",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
